LUMA SUMMARY:
Controlled Aisha test proves an important environmental effect: with Aisha's browser tab open, the previous QS run failed; after closing Aisha, the same setup worked. This isolates a likely browser/tab interaction variable and argues against immediately changing relay logic.</summary>
